    "detailed_description": "Mr. Mower is a challenging top-down lawnmowing simulator with a focus on avoiding obstacles as you mow your way through various lawns.<br><br>You are a lawnmower created by Hane, who is hoping to create her first successful project, help her accomplish her goal by becoming the best mower you can be.<br><br><u><strong>Features</strong></u><br><br>- Challenging top down movement where every second counts towards mowing lawns and not taking a hit<br>- An array of obstacles designed to put your mowing skills to the test.<br>- Extra challenge in the form of a collectable flower found throughout each lawn.",
